sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant WebApp as AsyncScapeIA.WebApp
    participant Worker as AsyncScapeIA.Workers
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL
    participant Storage as Object Storage
    participant Identity as OIDC Provider

    User->>Browser: Navigate to portal
    Browser->>Identity: OIDC authorize request
    Identity-->>Browser: Auth code / tokens
    Browser->>WebApp: Request catalog view (access token)
    WebApp->>Postgres: Query components + ownership
    WebApp-->>Browser: Render Blazor page
    rect rgb(200,200,255)
        Worker->>Postgres: Fetch pending sync jobs
        Worker->>Storage: Retrieve OpenAPI/AsyncAPI assets
        Worker->>Postgres: Upsert schema metadata
        Worker->>WebApp: Emit signal (optional) to refresh views
    end
    Worker->>OTEL: Emit telemetry (traces/metrics)
    WebApp->>OTEL: Emit telemetry
